		"步骤 2："
		"{image:atm:textures/questpics/convergence/step2.png width:150 height:100 align:center}"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"步骤 3："
		"{image:atm:textures/questpics/convergence/step3.png width:150 height:100 align:center}"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"步骤4，用扳手右键核心并在附近放置终端："
